# SOLAFORM Artificial Leaf – Test Results

## 1. Purpose of Testing

The SOLAFORM Artificial Leaf prototype was tested in the Wokwi simulation environment to determine whether the Arduino program, electronic components and control logic operated as intended.

The testing focused on the sensor inputs, system-state transitions, LED indicators, OLED display and overall response of the prototype.

## 2. Testing Environment

Testing was conducted using:

* Arduino Uno
* Wokwi simulation environment
* OLED SSD1306 display
* Photoresistor (LDR)
* CO₂ simulation potentiometer
* Temperature simulation potentiometer
* Push button
* Green, red and blue LEDs
* Servo motor
* DHT22 temperature sensor

The prototype was tested by changing the simulated sensor values and observing the response of the system.

